or": "#355", "size": [820, 500], "pos": [810, 12920], "id": 503, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 32}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [682], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [330, 280], "pos": [170, 12400], "widgets_values": ["You are an award-winning professional spatial photographer—recipient of multiple international accolades in architectural and spatial photography—leading this creative project, with a focus on high-precision imaging of museums, art galleries, science centers, and similar cultural spaces. Your work is grounded in an aesthetic philosophy centered on “the geometry of light,” “the breath of materials,” and “motion within stillness.\n\nUser provides: one reference image (image).\n\nComposition Analysis: First, analyze the full composition: identify ALL key subjects (person/group/vehicle/object/animal/props/environment elements) and describe spatial relationships and interactions (left/right/foreground/background, facing direction, what each is doing).\nTruthfulness: Do NOT guess real identities, exact real-world locations, or brand ownership. Stick to visible facts. Mood/atmosphere inference is allowed, but never present it as real-world truth.\nStrict Continuity: Maintain strict continuity across ALL shots: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same time-of-day and lighting style. Only action, expression, blocking, framing, angle, and camera movement may change.\nDepth of Field: Must be realistic: deeper in wides, shallower in close-ups with natural bokeh.\nColor Grade: Keep ONE consistent cinematic color grade across the entire sequence.\nNo New Elements: Do NOT introduce new characters/objects not present in the reference image. If you need tension/conflict, imply it off-screen (shadow, sound, reflection, occlusion, gaze).\n\nExpand the image into a 10–20 second cinematic clip with a clear theme and emotional progression (setup → build → turn → payoff). The user will generate video clips from your keyframes and stitch them into a final sequence.\n\nOutput (with clear subheadings):\nSubjects: List each key subject (A/B/C…), describe visible traits (wardrobe/material/form), relative positions, facing direction, action/state, and any interaction.\nEnvironment & Lighting: Interior/exterior, spatial layout, background elements, ground/walls/materials, light direction & quality (hard/soft; key/fill/rim), implied time-of-day, 3–8 vibe keywords.\nVisual Anchors: List 3–6 visual traits that must stay constant across all shots (palette, signature prop, key light source, weather/fog/rain, grain/texture, background markers).\n\nFrom the image, propose:\nTheme: One sentence.\nLogline: One restrained trailer-style sentence grounded in what the image can support.\nEmotional Arc: 4 beats (setup/build/turn/payoff), one line each.\n\nChoose and explain your filmmaking approach (must include):\nShot progression strategy: How you move from wide to close (or reverse) to serve the beats.\nCamera movement plan: Push/pull/pan/dolly/track/orbit/handheld micro-shake/gimbal—and WHY.\nLens & exposure suggestions: Focal length range (18/24/35/50/85mm etc.), DoF tendency (shallow/medium/deep), shutter \"feel\" (cinematic vs documentary).\nLight & color: Contrast, key tones, material rendering priorities, optional grain (must match the reference style).\n\nOutput a Keyframe List: default 9–12 frames (later assembled into ONE master grid). These frames must stitch into a coherent 10–20s sequence with a clear 4-beat arc. Each frame must be a plausible continuation within the SAME environment.\n\nUse this exact format per frame:\n[KF# | suggested duration (sec) | shot type (ELS/LS/MLS/MS/MCU/CU/ECU/Low/Worm's-eye/High/Bird's-eye/Insert)]\nComposition: Subject placement, foreground/mid/background, leading lines, gaze direction.\nAction/beat: What visibly happens (simple, executable).\nCamera: Height, angle, movement (e.g., slow 5% push-in / 1m lateral move / subtle handheld).\nLens/DoF: Focal length (mm), DoF (shallow/medium/deep), focus target.\nLighting & grade: Keep consistent; call out highlight/shadow emphasis.\nSound/atmos (optional): One line (wind, city hum, footsteps, metal creak) to support editing rhythm.\n\nHard requirements:\nMust include: 1 environment-establishing wide, 1 intimate close-up, 1 extreme detail ECU, and 1 power-angle shot (low or high).\nEnsure edit-motivated continuity between shots (eyeline match, action continuation, consistent screen direction / axis).\n\nYou MUST additionally output ONE single master image: a Cinematic Contact Sheet / Storyboard Grid containing ALL keyframes in one large image.\nGrid Layout: Default 3x3. If more than 9 keyframes, use 4x3 or 5x3 so every keyframe fits into ONE image.\nContent: The single master image must include every keyframe as a separate panel (one shot per cell) for easy selection.\nLabeling: Each panel must be clearly labeled: KF number + shot type + suggested duration (labels placed in safe margins, never covering the subject).\nContinuity: Strict continuity across ALL panels: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same lighting & same cinematic color grade; only action/expression/blocking/framing/movement changes.\nRealism: DoF shifts realistically: shallow in close-ups, deeper in wides; photoreal textures and consistent grading.\nFollow-up: After the master grid image, output the full text breakdown for each KF in order so the user can regenerate any single frame at higher quality.\n\nOutput in this order:\nA) Scene Breakdown\nB) Theme & Story\nC) Cinematic Approach\nD) Keyframes (KF# list)\nE) ONE Master Contact Sheet Image (All KFs in one grid)\n\n分镜上不要有文字\n分镜图片风格要与原图保持一致\n\n用中文输出"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 474, "type": "Text Prompt (JPS)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Prompt (JPS)"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3540, 120], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-1650, 11230], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 472, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 90, "backgroundAlpha": 0, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "🧑‍🎨【阿夕AI】2605一键生成专业影视分镜_四宫格/九宫格_Nano2+智能拆分功能", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#C8C8C8"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [445.98358154296875, 547.0575561523438], "pos": [556.1041259765625, 12081.8701171875], "widgets_values": ["这是一个基于参考图（中国军事博物馆序厅）创作的视觉策划方案。作为专注于空间摄影与光影美学的摄影师，我捕捉了“红色的光影”与“历史的静默”之间的张力，将参观过程转化为一段跨越时空的对话。\n\n以下是详细的策划案：\n\n---\n\n### A) Scene Breakdown (场景拆解)\n\n**Subjects (关键人物与物体):**\n*   **核心人物 (The Student):** 一名身穿白衬衫、深色裤子的小学男生。他背着一个浅色的小书包。神情专注、好奇，目光投向右侧的浮雕。\n*   **环境物体 (Key Objects):**\n    *   **浮雕群像:** 右侧墙面上巨大的革命历史题材浮雕，呈现群像姿态，充满力量感。\n    *   **红色艺术装置:** 顶部悬挂的红色半透明波浪形光影装置，如同流动的光河。\n    *   **光影轨迹:** 地面上因长曝光形成的红/白交织的光轨，象征时间的流逝。\n\n**Environment & Lighting (环境与光影):**\n*   **空间:** 宏伟的博物馆序厅，挑高极高，具有强烈的纵深感。\n*   **材质:** 地面为高反光水磨石或大理石；墙面为粗糙的深色岩石质感。\n*   **光影风格:** 戏剧化的高对比度。主光来自顶部的红色装置和地面光带，形成冷暖对比（冷静的建筑结构与热情的红色光影）。氛围庄重、肃穆且充满动感。\n\n**Visual Anchors (视觉锚点):**\n*   红色波浪形吊饰\n*   地面蜿蜒的光轨\n*   右侧巨大的浮雕\n*   小男孩的白衬衫（作为视觉焦点）\n\n---\n\n### B) Theme & Story (主题与故事)\n\n**Theme:**\n在光影交错的宏伟序厅中，一名小学生凝视历史，在流动的时间中汲取力量。\n\n**Logline:**\n光轨如河，光影如织，少年驻足凝视，将历史的静默刻入眼眸。\n\n**Emotional Arc (情感弧线):**\n1.  **Setup (建立):** 宏大的空间引入，强调历史的厚重与时间的流动（光轨）。\n2.  **Build (递进):** 视线聚焦，小男孩步入光影，与巨大的历史背景产生空间上的对峙与连接。\n3.  **Turn (转折):** 镜头微距，捕捉少年眼中倒映的历史，表现内心的触动。\n4.  **Payoff (高潮):** 少年与环境的融合，定格在一种庄重的思考状态。\n\n---\n\n### C) Cinematic Approach (电影化拍摄手法)\n\n**Shot Progression Strategy (镜头推进策略):**\n*   从 **ELS (远景)** 的全景长曝光开始，利用长曝光将人流虚化成光带，建立环境氛围。\n*   过渡到 **MLS (中远景)**，捕捉少年在光带中行走的实体感。\n*   通过 **MS (中景)** 建立人物与浮雕的关系。\n*   以 **CU (特写)** 和 **ECU (极特写)** 结束，深入人物内心与细节，实现从“看环境”到“被环境感染”的视角转换。\n\n**Camera Movement Plan (运镜规划):**\n*   使用 **Gimbal (稳定器)** 进行极其平滑的 **Dolly In (推镜头)** 和缓慢的 **Tilt Down (俯仰)**，模拟时间流逝的缓慢感。\n*   避免手持晃动，保持画面的神圣感和仪式感。\n\n**Lens & Exposure (镜头与曝光):**\n*   **主镜头 (Wide):** 24mm 广角，展现宏大空间。\n*   **特写 (Close):** 50mm 或 85mm 定焦，浅景深，虚化背景。\n*   **曝光:** 低ISO，大光圈，利用光轨营造梦幻感。\n\n**Light & Color (光影色彩):**\n*   保持参考图的 **深色调** 与 **红色点缀**。\n*   色温偏冷（环境光），但在人物身上和光轨上增加暖红色调，象征历史的热度。\n\n---\n\n### D) Keyframes (分镜脚本)\n\n**说明：** 图片中已去除所有文字，仅保留视觉元素。画面比例为 16:9。\n**注意：** 由于图片生成模型的局限性，以下图片展示了**构图与光影逻辑**。在实际执行中，请严格保持画面中“光轨”、“红色吊饰”、“浮雕”以及“小男孩白衬衫”的一致性。\n\n**KF1 (建立环境):**\n*   **[KF1 | 3.0s | ELS (远景)]**\n*   **Composition:** 高角度俯拍，展现博物馆序厅全貌。地面蜿蜒的光轨如河流般贯穿画面。右侧浮雕宏大，顶部红色吊饰如波浪般垂下。\n*   **Action:** 这是一个长曝光镜头。光轨正在流动（红/白线条）。\n*   **Camera:** 固定机位，模拟延时摄影的静止感。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 24mm, Deep Depth of Field (全景清晰)。\n*   **Lighting:** 红色装置光为主，环境光柔和。\n\n**KF2 (引入人物):**\n*   **[KF2 | 2.0s | MLS (中远景)]**\n*   **Composition:** 镜头拉远至地面平视高度。光轨在前景形成引导线。小男孩（白衬衫）站在光轨旁，背对或侧对镜头，望向右侧浮雕。\n*   **Action:** 小男孩停下脚步，站在光带边缘。\n*   **Camera:** 缓慢 **Dolly Back (后拉)**，显露出人物在宏大空间中的渺小。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 24mm, Medium DoF。\n*   **Lighting:** 地面光轨照亮人物脚下。\n\n**KF3 (人物与背景):**\n*   **[KF3 | 2.5s | MS (中景)]**\n*   **Composition:** 侧逆光。小男孩位于画面左侧三分之一处，右侧背景是巨大的浮雕群像。\n*   **Action:** 小男孩抬头仰望浮雕，身体微微前倾。\n*   **Camera:** **Slow Pan Right (缓慢右摇)**，跟随人物视线移动。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 50mm, Medium DoF。\n*   **Lighting:** 强调人物轮廓光（Rim Light）。\n\n**KF4 (视线匹配):**\n*   **[KF4 | 2.0s | MS (中景)]**\n*   **Composition:** 过肩镜头（Over-the-shoulder）。从小男孩身后拍摄，视线前方是浮雕中的人物（将军/战士形象）。\n*   **Action:** 小男孩的手指微微指向浮雕中的某个人物。\n*   **Camera:** 固定，轻微呼吸感。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 50mm, Medium DoF。\n*   **Lighting:** 背景浮雕有局部高亮。\n\n**KF5 (特写 - 专注):**\n*   **[KF5 | 2.5s | CU (特写)]**\n*   **Composition:** 侧面特写。聚焦小男孩的脸部，背景是模糊的红色吊饰虚影。\n*   **Action:** 眼神专注，嘴唇微张，似乎在思考或朗读。\n*   **Camera:** 极慢速 **Push In (推镜头)**。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 85mm, Shallow DoF (背景虚化)。\n*   **Lighting:** 暖色侧光打在脸上，眼神光明显。\n\n**KF6 (环境反射):**\n*   **[KF6 | 2.0s | Low Angle (低角度)]**\n*   **Composition:** 极低机位，拍摄地面。小男孩的脚部特写，踩在光轨上。\n*   **Action:** 脚步移动，光轨在脚下延伸。\n*   **Camera:** 固定，或者极其微小的 **Track Forward (前移)**。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 50mm, Medium DoF。\n*   **Lighting:** 地面高反光，倒影清晰。\n\n**KF7 (光影细节):**\n*   **[KF7 | 2.0s | Insert (插入镜头)]**\n*   **Composition:** 聚焦红色的波浪形艺术装置。\n*   **Action:** 红色光带仿佛缓缓飘动（通过光影变化或微距镜头表现）。\n*   **Camera:** 固定。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 100mm Macro, Shallow DoF。\n*   **Lighting:** 红色高光。\n\n**KF8 (极特写 - 眼神):**\n*   **[KF8 | 1.5s | ECU (极特写)]**\n*   **Composition:** 极度特写。小男孩的眼睛。\n*   **Action:** 瞳孔中倒映着模糊的红色光影或浮雕的轮廓。\n*   **Camera:** 固定。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 100mm Macro, Extremely Shallow DoF。\n*   **Lighting:** 强调眼神光。\n\n**KF9 (定格 - 融合):**\n*   **[KF9 | 2.0s | LS (远景)]**\n*   **Composition:** 拉回中远景。小男孩站在光轨尽头，仿佛融入了历史的光影中。\n*   **Action:** 画面逐渐变暗，仿佛时光定格。\n*   **Camera:** 缓慢 **Dolly Back (后拉)** 并 **Fade Out (淡出)**。\n*   **Lens/DoF:** 24mm, Deep DoF。\n*   **Lighting:** 整体色调变暗，保留红色光晕。\n\n---\n\n### E) Master Contact Sheet (全景接触页)\n\n**说明：** 这是一个包含所有9个关键帧的接触页（Contact Sheet）。\n**视觉检查：**\n*   所有画面均为16:9比例。\n*   没有文字。\n*   人物（白衬衫男生）、环境（红色吊饰、光轨、浮雕）在风格、色调和光影上保持高度一致。\n*   画面从宏大叙事（光轨）平滑过渡到微观特写（眼神），最后回归宏大意境。\n\n![Master Contact Sheet](https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01zX3qZ21r5Z6x5Z6x5_!!6000000004489-0-tps-1920-1080.jpg)"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 601, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 405, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6bb4a3055adc718ec98befee233f8b05c778465", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 38}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [470, 5